567 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 339 0 R
/E (A half-hour AI course for the AI side of keeping their money safe. It teaches one thing: Screens can lie. A screen can fake a picture, a voice, even a confident answer, and look completely real. The fakes that matter most are the ones after your money. )
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
