<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 342 0 R
/E (  Two rules carry this half-hour cyber course. Your secret word is never shared, and the moment someone asks for it, you tell a grown-up.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
628 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 342 0 R
/E (Some people online are not who they say they are, and they want one of two things: your secret, or your money. A secret is the PIN, the OTP, the password, the little key that opens the money box. So the course drills two rules a nine year-old can hold on to under pressure. Your secret word is never shared, with anyone, ever. And the moment someone asks for it, rushes you, or dangles a fortune, you tell a grown-up. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
